.TH CASSINI-VIEWER 1 "October 2026" "cassini-viewer 0.2.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
cassini-viewer \- play meeting recordings and read along with their transcripts
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B cassini-viewer
[\fIOPTION\fR...] [\fIFILE\fR...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B cassini-viewer
opens Cassini portable meetings: Ogg Opus recordings that carry their own
word-timed transcript, speaker names and summary in the Opus comment header.
The transcript follows playback; clicking a word plays from there.
Ordinary Opus files play without a transcript.
.PP
Each \fIFILE\fR opens in its own window.
.SH OPTIONS
Standard GTK and GApplication options are accepted; see
.B cassini-viewer \-\-help\-all.
.SH SEE ALSO
https://format.gocassini.com/ \- the Cassini portable meeting format.
.SH BUGS
https://github.com/codemyriad/cassini-gnome/issues
